  <para>
  Set a host name for your system. If you do not set a host name but have it assigned with
  DHCP, the transient host name <literal>agama</literal> will be used for the installation.
  </para>
  <informalfigure>
    <mediaobject>
      <textobject role="description"><phrase>Registration</phrase>
      </textobject>
